{"id":"3d6935a1d07e61f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-lie-algebra.md","title":"Lie Algebra","display":"df-lie-algebra — Lie Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lie-algebra","aliases":["58-df-lie-algebra"],"display":"df-lie-algebra — Lie Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-bilinear]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lie-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lie-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lie-algebra — Lie Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05b5dba2baae641d\" href=\"?note=05b5dba2baae641d\" title=\"58-df-bilinear\">58-df-bilinear</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak g\">\\(\\mathfrak g\\)</span> (vector space over a locally quantified field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\cdot,\\cdot]:\\mathfrak{g}\\times\\mathfrak{g}\\to\\mathfrak{g}\">\\([\\cdot,\\cdot]:\\mathfrak{g}\\times\\mathfrak{g}\\to\\mathfrak{g}\\)</span> (bracket)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\\)</span> (vector-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieAlg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LieAlg}_S\\)</span> (defined here; Lie algebra predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k\\)</span> (bilinearity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lie\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{LieAlg}_S(\\mathfrak g,[\\cdot,\\cdot])\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(\\mathfrak g,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g})\\land\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k([\\cdot,\\cdot],\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathfrak g\\;([x,x]=0)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\bigl([x,[y,z]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[y,[z,x]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[z,[x,y]]=0_{\\mathfrak g}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lie\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{LieAlg}_S(\\mathfrak g,[\\cdot,\\cdot])\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(\\mathfrak g,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g})\\land\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k([\\cdot,\\cdot],\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathfrak g\\;([x,x]=0)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\bigl([x,[y,z]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[y,[z,x]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[z,[x,y]]=0_{\\mathfrak g}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lie algebras satisfy alternating bracket and Jacobi identity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bilinear","status":"resolved","id":"05b5dba2baae641d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bilinear]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak g","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"[\\cdot,\\cdot]:\\mathfrak{g}\\times\\mathfrak{g}\\to\\mathfrak{g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LieAlg}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lie\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{LieAlg}_S(\\mathfrak g,[\\cdot,\\cdot])\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(\\mathfrak g,+_{\\mathfrak g},\\cdot_{\\mathfrak g})\\land\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k([\\cdot,\\cdot],\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g,\\mathfrak g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathfrak g\\;([x,x]=0)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\bigl([x,[y,z]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[y,[z,x]]+_{\\mathfrak g}[z,[x,y]]=0_{\\mathfrak g}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1185,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-776","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-lie-algebra.md|58-df-lie-algebra]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","05b5dba2baae641d","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}